WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:08.434
Na farko, a rayuwa da kwamfuta, hankali yana hawa matakai tara ta hanyar sake maimaita siginar.

2
00:00:08.774 --> 00:00:23.051
Na biyu, AI na yau ya tsaya a mataki na 5, amfani da kayan aiki, saboda ayyukan yau da kullun suna farka manyan samfuran daga sifili.

3
00:00:23.391 --> 00:00:35.289
Na uku, tattara amsoshin da aka tabbatar a cikin ƙarancin ƙarfin bincike yana ƙetare wannan bango kuma yana buɗe matakan 4 na sama.
